                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1103afa2-8e4c-4f08-bb63-bcb359494b9d",
                                                "sense_id": "4cfd11b9-7ccc-3076-9113-a5344bde9721",
                                                "text": "Beware of enlisting in your vigilant fisheries any lad with lean brow and hollow eye; given to unseasonable meditativeness; and who offers to ship with the Phaedon instead of Bowditch in his head."
